# TUNNEL_TOKEN cannot be auto-generated — create it yourself:
#   cloudflared tunnel login
#   cloudflared tunnel create sieve
#   cloudflared tunnel token sieve      # prints the token to use here
# Then, in the Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard, add a Public Hostname for
# each service under this tunnel, pointing at http://traefik:80 as the
# origin (cloudflared reaches Traefik by container name over sieve_proxy —
# no host port needed). See ../README.md.
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
